      "before": "<h1>关卡04&nbsp;</h1><h1><div></div></h1><h3><b>新一循环<span>醒来，严格按照以下步骤执行（时间紧张，需要2~3分钟全部完成）</span></b></h3><h1><div><span>1.出房间左拐第一个房间，前往RAFAEL的房间，打开电脑，密码MIRANDA（建议提前一循环解锁），解除安防措施；</span></div><div><div><span>2.量子电池插电；</span></div><div>3.从圆门去车库，关闭垃圾清理，拿到焚化炉钥匙；<br></div><div><span style=\"text-align: center;\">4.打开焚化炉，</span><span style=\"text-align: center\">拿到USB Key</span><br></div><div><span>5.直奔大厅电脑，使用USB Key，关闭电脑更新；</span></div><div>6.返回厨房机器人区域，电脑停止更新，<span>获取蓝图调节器</span><span>。</span></div></div><div><div data-img-block=\"\"></div><div data-img-block=\"\"><img src=\"assets/32514789788da0661df2da53410605e9a37ee09627a76a8dd4c8b85e462158d4.webp\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" style=\"width:80%;display:block;border-radius:4px;margin:8px auto;\"><div data-caption=\"\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span>1.出房间左拐第一个房间，前往RAFAEL的房间，打开电脑，密码MIRANDA（建议提前一循环解锁），骇入防火墙2次，</span><span>解除安防措施</span><br></div></div></div><div><div data-img-block=\"\"><img src=\"assets/323f91d7a6fc48ac9d370644c64316d74f0417b967a79b2c951688985f8fc804.webp\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" style=\"width:80%;display:block;border-radius:4px;margin:8px auto;\"><div data-caption=\"\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span>2.量子电池插电</span><br></div></div><div><img src=\"assets/0bb2ad7d0a0217b50a44c91632dfa22cbb8b65f1c4445f5b78f7b9d3db24dcfe.webp\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" style=\"width:80%;display:block;border-radius:4px;margin:8px auto;\"><img src=\"assets/0f4ffb916802474264e20a06e50240a17df1ebb67b3150c556e4bdf7e0cc23b9.webp\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" style=\"width:80%;display:block;border-radius:4px;margin:8px auto;\"><div data-img-block=\"\"><img src=\"assets/577c78187412f75edf2e1d665a283c5a89454caf2af89fa18850d5586a252044.webp\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" style=\"width:80%;display:block;border-radius:4px;margin:8px auto;\"><div data-caption=\"\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span>3.从圆门去车库，关闭垃圾清理，拿到焚化炉钥匙；</span><br></div></div><div><div data-img-block=\"\"><img src=\"assets/3bb2fdf28db2d9e050c93aa13953a6dc08c8abe0922220c8e256a11a4c103244.webp\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" style=\"width:80%;display:block;border-radius:4px;margin:8px auto;\"><div data-caption=\"\" style=\"text-align: center\">4.打开焚化炉，<span>拿到USB Key</span></div></div><div><div data-img-block=\"\"><img src=\"assets/af8c109194156bdf96e9ed51de4f0a4120d5947a5970ad63c51269cc62a3d4be.webp\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" style=\"width:80%;display:block;border-radius:4px;margin:8px auto;\"><div data-caption=\"\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span>5.直奔大厅电脑，使用USB Key，关闭电脑更新；</span><br></div></div><div><div data-img-block=\"\"><img src=\"assets/352e05fb075991b7ba4d92732e84c4c0171ef55af34f3f8311132fee418a4d0c.webp\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" style=\"width:80%;display:block;border-radius:4px;margin:8px auto;\"><div data-caption=\"\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span>6.返回厨房机器人区域，电脑停止更新，</span><span>获取蓝图调节器</span><span>。</span><br></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></h1><h3><div>注意：游戏接近尾声，需按顺序在一个循环内完成：</div><div><span>从实验室前往温室，解开星座谜题，拿到JAHI房间摇把，打开JAHI房间，解开时钟齿轮谜题，恢复JAHI电脑，拿到蓝图调节器的4个电子材料清单，最后去车库用3D打印机制作调节器，制作好后，用于列车前往聚变核心，获取关卡05门禁卡，打开JONNY房间，穿越至聚变核心控制台，解锁逃生舱，通关游戏。</span></div></h3><h2><span>新一循环，坐列车（用电池）前往实验室，进入温室</span></h2><h1><div><div data-img-block=\"\"></div><div data-img-block=\"\"><img src=\"assets/5bfa7be6d52b8ccc481a7b8f6a05b045e63e238d45bab74c79aa5965724208ae.webp\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" style=\"width:80%;display:block;border-radius:4px;margin:8px auto;\"><div data-caption=\"\" style=\"text-align: center\">按住1，打开2，查阅星座列表，截图保存，按3切换黑夜，再次按1（变蓝），抬头看星座符号及颜色，，查阅星座手册，得到3组图案</div></div><div><img src=\"assets/9e6ce7f8c3a1a4c13b4ccc8f9f1ad101e9630406f74f6d1570b2fe002163f619.webp\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" style=\"width:80%;display:block;border-radius:4px;margin:8px auto;\"><img src=\"assets/03f2c17320b9a99a69707ae22bb635f477dc35d00c626ec5b5d259f0aa29498b.webp\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" style=\"width:80%;display:block;border-radius:4px;margin:8px auto;\"><img src=\"assets/368fc397fb549c97d25e392cfd64b2936e36003a3a3e1355326da236ee54f7ea.webp\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" style=\"width:80%;display:block;border-radius:4px;margin:8px auto;\"><img src=\"assets/6ddbe8c507d7fd02d33d78ab0ae1ed51e278e6c023f86eabc0569fe248716490.webp\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" style=\"width:80%;display:block;border-radius:4px;margin:8px auto;\"><div data-img-block=\"\"><img src=\"assets/02b12ecfb29b7f5449e56909056f97f0f7a8de4070e15acc6274120a38de5cc5.webp\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" style=\"width:80%;display:block;border-radius:4px;margin:8px auto;\"><div data-caption=\"\" style=\"text-align: center\">棚屋左侧输入3组符号</div></div><div data-img-block=\"\"><img src=\"assets/9d8fa2c573fe0af707d7545cc0b7e2edc8e65207d28e1f3ab18bbd09963655bd.webp\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" style=\"width:80%;display:block;border-radius:4px;margin:8px auto;\"><div data-caption=\"\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span>打开密码箱，拿到【把手】，前往JAHI房间</span></div></div><div><img src=\"assets/4cd58dfa83149450e8d99fec0aa33fa053ce0ac1a87d0a2a4ac8aed47adcf06b.webp\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" style=\"width:80%;display:block;border-radius:4px;margin:8px auto;\"></div><div><div data-img-block=\"\"><img src=\"assets/4b6d4853c987c3c0badba6108b425527df97c7890e6bf91464db14791a64ddfb.webp\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" style=\"width:80%;display:block;border-radius:4px;margin:8px auto;\"><div data-caption=\"\" style=\"text-align: center\">按顺序，从1至7找到并插入所有齿轮</div></div><div><img src=\"assets/6639d38c46ae699235e2bb78882f63590e132cf6137fd3ffe3729aa89efd6c4b.webp\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" style=\"width:80%;display:block;border-radius:4px;margin:8px auto;\"></div></div></div></div><div><img src=\"assets/249e5caf5060597d68a354b42756b0008faf0f3a9c2b5a61e0be83b5c78dd186.webp\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" style=\"width:80%;display:block;border-radius:4px;margin:8px auto;\"><img src=\"assets/d9e7da81c3bdc70d4bd18f68cf056d18628da7141f5cc21ea0d1e420b8085c13.webp\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" style=\"width:80%;display:block;border-radius:4px;margin:8px auto;\"><div data-img-block=\"\"><img src=\"assets/f4ec41eabb4c0cb52a0089ff106b84eecaa99dd92ea9c7ad06df1d5d5a6e1335.webp\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" style=\"width:80%;display:block;border-radius:4px;margin:8px auto;\"><div data-caption=\"\" style=\"text-align: center\"><div>依次输入<span><br></span></div><div><span>ASROOT EXTRACT DataLensArchive.qpak</span><br></div><div><span>CAT Readme.note</span></div><div>BUILD DataLensInstaller.qb<br></div><div>Datalens.exe train_components_list.dtl</div></div></div></div><div><img src=\"assets/ee10b0086e37a5816cb3bff0d61460de672fffcce082f3bd4a6f6173817b8198.webp\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" style=\"width:80%;display:block;border-radius:4px;margin:8px auto;\"></div><div><div data-img-block=\"\"><img src=\"assets/dad969685d3db5e4aeccefdd84fa0942b117c9b20e81d44c2c26b75c2fd5ef68.webp\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" style=\"width:80%;display:block;border-radius:4px;margin:8px auto;\"><div data-caption=\"\" style=\"text-align: center\">制作好后插入列车，修复聚变核心轨道</div></div></div></h1>",
